\\\":\\\"lin\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"develop\\\",\\\"ability\\\":null,\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The related-capability search found watering and casing separation, neither of which creates an additional rooted plant. Watering commons-berry-0-0 at its measured moisture 0.65 is not indicated by the berry requirement 0.6. Develop a general seed-propagation operation, initially supporting extraction and sowing trials where the represented plant biology permits them. Seed presence, viability, germination requirements and growth timing must be resolved in the current development handoff, not inferred from the name 'berry' or replaced by an instant plant grant.\\\",\\\"specification\\\":\\\"General operation: propagate from seed, parameterized by owned source item, quantity, accessible planting site and work ID, with extract, sow, inspect, pause, resume and cancel modes. Initial scope is hand extraction and shallow sowing of seeds that can actually be separated by hand; this does not presume tools, vessels, suitable cuttings or seeds in inventory. Exact immediate source candidate: item-6-lin-57, six berries owned by lin, origin commons-berry-0-0. Recheck its surviving quantity, decay and ownership at execution; do not consume all six by default. commons-berry-0-0 is a parent reference, not a supply of free cuttings or permission to damage it. The later tick-20 observation still reports stock 6 and moisture 0.65; other plants' fruit stocks do not establish propagation feasibility.\\\\nDevelopment handoff must inspect the existing biological representation and related handlers before coding. Reuse and record applicable inventory, observation, soil, growth, decay and work code by exact handler/revision where available; recorded related contracts include rooted-plant-watering, forest.gather at foundation-forest@1, and open.probe at foundation-open@1. Do not claim their implementation as new invention. Missing seed separation, seed identity, sowing or establishment mechanisms belong in this same handoff. Add only the minimum coherent seed lifecycle needed; do not add an unrelated toolmaking or agriculture roadmap. If berry seed anatomy or germination cannot yet be supported by justified biological parameters, implement the actual extraction/site-inspection precursor and report the precise remaining dependency rather than generating a rooted plant.\\\\nProposed work costs: learning 4 active study rounds; each study round uses 0.2 energy, with ordinary hunger/time continuing. One extraction attempt uses one whole surviving berry, one active round and 0.5 energy. It produces only seeds actually represented inside that berry plus its separated pulp/residue; retain source age, decay and lineage, and partition the original material mass rather than multiplying it. Viability is initially unknown. An extraction yielding no seed is a paid, informative failure, not a seed grant. No food value may remain duplicated across source, seeds and residue. A non-destructive planting-site inspection uses one round and 0.2 energy. Sowing up to the seeds obtained from that berry uses two work rounds and 1 energy per round: first prepare a small hand-workable patch, then place seeds and cover it. Hard ground, inaccessible sites, unsuitable soil or a preparation requiring absent equipment must fail preflight without charging the unperformed phase. No vessel, imported soil, fertilizer, water, tool or reserved land is supplied. Any additional material requirement must be quoted from the actual method and supplied before execution; otherwise that method is unavailable.\\\\nBefore sowing is enabled, the handoff must supply executable species-specific sowing depth, spacing, permissible soil and temperature conditions, germination delay and establishment/maturity thresholds, grounded in the actual biology/model rather than fruit stock. These unresolved values are development dependencies, not zero costs or an arbitrary fixed-era unlock. Persist elapsed eligible growth time, seed condition, moisture exposure, failures and lineage. Soil requirements must be explicit; do not silently treat moisture 0.6 for an established berry as a proven germination requirement. Every actual seed is transferred from inventory to a site record. A rooted seedling is created only after a real successful establishment transition; its initial fruit stock is zero. Growth and later fruit production require the existing growth model or an explicitly implemented compatible extension with accounted substrate, water and environmental energy inputs. Neither this review nor waiting for development advances time.\\\\nWork stores actor, exact source/site IDs, reserved quantities, completed phases and costs. Recheck reach, ownership, site availability and prerequisites before each paid phase. Pause on interruption; resume only remaining labor after revalidation. Cancel releases unprocessed reservations once, preserving already separated material, prepared ground and sown seeds. Spent energy, elapsed time and consumed/degraded material are not refunded. Death cancels actor work, releases surviving carried work materials at the worksite under ordinary death rules, and does not erase already sown seeds. Germination, decay and established growth continue during ordinary world time independently of the actor; global simulation pauses freeze them. Maintenance is actual inspection and, only when indicated and independently performed, watering through rooted-plant-watering using real water and its existing costs. Do not invoke another participant or grant skill automatically. Implement all resolved checks and transitions in code, not recurring model review.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":4,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"No benefit for the request, development, naming, study completion or mastery. A completed extraction, measured site investigation, informative failed trial or observed establishment may count only when it gives lin personally new, evidence-backed information. Familiar successful care may support modest satisfaction without requiring novelty. For any such implemented credit, use the existing experience mechanism with functional deduplication by lineage/site, property and evidence event; at most one short-pleasure increment of 0.01 and one maintained-satisfaction increment of 0.01 per qualifying event, combined propagation contribution capped at 0.1, cooldown 10 rounds per equivalent result, satisfaction decay 0.002 per ordinary round. Repeated status queries and unobserved background growth earn nothing. No physical-comfort award is proposed; physical comfort remains capped at 10. Do not change basic nutrition, protected reward accounts, budgets, goals or permissions.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Emit observable, timestamped extraction, sowing, inspection, establishment, failure and death events only when those actions or transitions occur. Reusable visual metadata must include work ID, source lineage, site position, phase, completed/required labor, visible material state, plant stage and evidence ID. Distinguish unverified seed, sown patch, emerged seedling and established plant. Failed extraction shows no seed product; sowing is not displayed as a rooted plant, and interrupted work never displays completion. Growth may exist without immediate personal knowledge; update personal records only through an actual observation.\\\"},{\\\"actor\\\":\\\"ivo\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"reuse\\\",\\\"ability\\\":\\\"probe\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The existing probe directly covers observation and small physical trials on an owned unfamiliar sample, including this request's feasible low-risk precursor. Ivo now actually owns item-20-ivo-201, one hazelnut gathered at tick 20; gathering is no longer merely hypothetical. Probe does not provide a nutritional or toxicological assay, and neither the food name nor a mechanical result establishes safety. Casing separation is a distinct existing operation, not grounds for inventing a new assessment skill or assuming its tools are present.\\\",\\\"specification\\\":\\\"Reuse probe, equivalence open-baseline:probe:1, handler open.probe, revision foundation-open@1. Preserve its exact parameter interface: target string, mode observe/press/wet/heat, intensity number 0 through 1, with no additional parameters. Initial applicable call targets item-20-ivo-201 in observe mode; only visible properties are reportable. Observe costs one round and 0.2 energy. A physical trial costs one round, 0.5 energy and 0.1 actual sample unit. Each execution is one interaction, not a continuing investigation or automatic sequence. Resolve the exact owned, reachable surviving sample before charging; a physical trial requires at least 0.1 unreserved unit. Record the sampled portion and its resulting residue, damage or loss, subtracting it from intact stock without duplicate edible output or renewed freshness. Retain source start-1-nuts, harvest tick 20 and inherited decay. No automatic ingestion, tasting, toxin exposure or health challenge is authorized.\\\\nObserve may establish only actually visible color, casing condition, visible spoilage or other directly accessible features. Press may establish only the actual response at the chosen intensity. A failure to open or deform the casing is evidence of that trial, not evidence of safety or poor nutrition. Wet and heat require actual water or heat access and any necessary safe handling materials; none is established here. Quote and satisfy those prerequisites through existing contracts before attempting them; never interpret the mode name as free water, fire, cooking or detoxification. Initially limit work to observation and feasible external mechanical trials. Internal kernel properties are inaccessible until the casing is actually opened. For controlled cracking, independently learn and execute crack-and-separate-casing with its existing learning duration 3 and full contract: an owned appropriate striker and an appropriate stable support are required, with per-block impact/separation costs and wear. No such equipment is currently established. Do not redevelop that function or imply this probe review teaches it.\\\\nProbe supplies no calibrated nutritional analysis, chemical assay or comprehensive toxin screen. Nutrition and toxicity remain unknown unless a genuinely valid measurement or independently obtained applicable evidence establishes them; do not expose hidden resource fields. Even an apparently normal kernel, successful heating or resemblance to a known food cannot establish absence of toxins or an exact nutritional value. Known berry nutrition 8/toxicity 0 and root nutrition 14/toxicity 0 are not comparison assays for hazelnuts. If adequate assay mechanisms and equipment are later requested, review their missing functions through development rather than permanently rejecting them. No invented equipment or automatic consumption is part of this reuse.\\\\nPreserve execution.duration 1, interruption cancel and progress semantics: only a completed interaction commits its result, and repetition is a new paid interaction. Interrupted work cannot claim a finding. Preserve any real partial physical change and spent inputs if they already occurred; release unconsumed reservations once, with no refund of spent effort, time or consumed sample. Resume means a fresh, revalidated execution rather than double-charging or duplicating an old result. Death leaves surviving material under normal death rules and cancels pending action. There is no ongoing assay process or maintenance; the remaining sample continues normal decay. Each participant must communicate any finding through actual independent action. Keep existing executable checks and handlers; missing enforcement is an implementation correction, not a new claimed invention.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":0,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Preserve probe's existing effects; this review grants no new reward. Queries, requests, naming and mere possession give no experience benefit. Only actual justified observations, including informative mechanical failure, are eligible under existing experience rules, with evidence and personal applicability. Do not award both an observation and a separately renamed assessment for the same fact. Any future experience integration must specify bounded credit, cooldown and decay before enabling it; no new pleasure or satisfaction credit is authorized here. No comfort or nutrition benefit arises from handling an uneaten sample, and no protected reward account, budget, goal or permission is altered.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Reuse probe interaction visuals with exact item ID, position, mode, intensity, action phase, evidence event and observable before/after condition. Show observation or actual deformation, damage, wetting or heating only when performed. A cancelled or failed interaction cannot display a completed assessment, open kernel, cooked food or safety badge. Keep nutrition and toxicity explicitly unknown in personal records; reference observation evidence rather than revealing hidden values. Tool-dependent cracking has its own existing work and product visuals and must not appear merely because a probe was requested.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"521f4201-4351-487a-8edf-59092d55aa9a","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"bounded_decision","description":null,"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["queries","result_json"],"properties":{"queries":{"type":"array","maxItems":4,"items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["section","search","ids","offset","part"],"properties":{"section":{"type":"string","enum":["abilities","inventory","knowledge","projects","memory","state","observed"]},"search":{"type":"string","maxLength":400},"ids":{"type":"array","maxIt